329_5238739324531860630_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IPydM9JraTwQ7kNvwEvKmhp&_nc_oc=AdrhElHzXJFAq4zLDNMY6VoSSltC6VefFHU6468dCCPNny_VVM6059KjNlkNXRHsKJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKfytyZ9RhVoua4ABjnJq0hKqxs32asbvery34CcP4Vag&oe=6AA41726"}, "display_name": "Ambulance Life", "keywords": ["VRAmbulanceGame", "AmbulanceSimulator", "EmergencyDriving", "MedicalRescue", "DrivingSimulatorVR"], "long_description": "Step into the role of an emergency responder in a realistic VR ambulance simulation where speed, precision, and decision-making are critical.\n\nRace against time through busy city streets, respond to emergency calls, and safely transport patients to the hospital. Navigate dynamic traffic, use sirens strategically, and choose the fastest routes while maintaining control under pressure.\n\nBeyond driving, experience the responsibility of emergency response. Each mission presents different scenarios, requiring quick reactions and careful handling. From urgent transports to critical situations, every call feels intense and meaningful.\n\nWith immersive VR visuals, realistic vehicle handling, and authentic emergency atmosphere, the game delivers a compelling ambulance driving experience that blends realism with engaging gameplay.\n\nGet behind the wheel, activate the sirens, and answer the call \u2014 lives depend on you.", "short_description": "A realistic VR ambulance simulation where every second matters. Drive through city traffic, respond to emergencies, and save lives."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://atakanerdeger.github.io/gametriclabs/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "\u0130N\u0130T\u0130UM STUD\u0130O", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://atakanerdeger.github.io/gametriclabs/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534",